  "description": "This is a full application by the Hampstead Garden Suburb Trust for a change of use of the existing disused tennis court that it owns (Class F2), to a new Heritage Orchard (Sui Generis). The ‘heritage’ aspect relates to the restoration of the orchard that was part of the original drawings for Central Square as outlined above. It also relates to the proposed planting plan, largely based on heritage species common at the time of the Suburb’s founding in the early 1900s. The Trust has sought pre-app advice from Barnet which was supportive of the scheme in principle.\n",
